# AirCare Environment Configuration
#
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# In client-side Single Page Applications built with Vite/React, any environment variable
# prefixed with VITE_* is embedded directly into the public client-side JavaScript bundle during build.
# They are visible in browser DevTools and network traces.
# DO NOT store confidential backend secret keys here.
#
# Optional: WAQI / AQICN Public API Token
# If provided, AirCare will query direct physical station telemetry from the World Air Quality Index project.
# Tokens obtained from https://aqicn.org/data-platform/token/ are public client tokens.
# If left blank, AirCare seamlessly uses the Open-Meteo High-Resolution Atmospheric Model with CPCB NAQI algorithms.
VITE_WAQI_API_KEY=
